# Allowlist: package only the bundles, the built UI (with its font licences), the manifest,
# the README and licence/notice files. Sources, tests, scripts and tsconfig never ship.
# vsce applies every "!" pattern after all ignore patterns, so keep the list explicit.
**
!dist/extension.cjs
!dist/agent-office-hook.cjs
!media/**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.md
!LICENSE.txt
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
